st_played": 1701434720, "avatar": "3f055d105dabbc966b3c1d784aa6d685db155a46"}, "language": "english", "review": "Alien Swarm is an adrenaline-pumping cooperative shooter that captivates with its intense action and strategic game play. The game's collaborative mechanics encourage teamwork, making it a thrilling experience to navigate through hordes of extraterrestrial adversaries aka the swarm swarm.\n\nOne of the best aspects of Alien Swarm is its emphasis on teamwork. Coordinating with teammates, each with their specialised abilities and roles, adds depth to the game play. Whether you're the medic, Weapons specialist, or technician, every role feels crucial to the team's success. The amount of weapons and equipment available allows for diverse play styles, experimentation and customisation, in order to complete the levels, add a nicer difficulty aspect to the game. This game also adds a lot of strategy talk among the players making the successful mission feel so much more sweeter.\n\nHowever, on to the more negative things while the cooperative aspect is its strength, the game's reliance on teamwork might be a downside for some players who prefer a more solo experience . Additionally, connectivity issues can disrupt the otherwise immersive game play. Most importantly this game only has one campaign, providing only 1 and a half hours of game play at most which is a tad bit disappointing.\n\nOverall, Alien Swarm is a fantastic free-to-play game that offers a thrilling cooperative experience. Its engaging game play and emphasis on teamwork make it a standout title in the sci-fi shooter genre, perfect for players who enjoy challenging missions and intense combat scenarios.", "timestamp_created": 1701579073, "timestamp_updated": 1701579073, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}]}